Licensing of this repository

Fonts and their license files under src/galley_pdf_fonts/data/<family>/ are
not covered by this file: each font is under its own license, named in the
license field of its entry in src/galley_pdf_fonts/data/fonts.toml (OFL-1.1,
Bitstream Vera and Arev licenses with public domain changes, GUST Font
License). The license text lies in the same directory as the font: from the
font release or, for an entry with license_url, downloaded from that URL and
checked against license_sha256.

The code of this repository - src/galley_pdf_fonts/__init__.py, scripts/,
tests/, pyproject.toml, fonts.toml and README.md - is under the same terms as
the galley repository: copyright the galley authors, all rights reserved; no
license is granted yet.
